From: A. Donz <Avrova@Donz.si>
Subject: [PATCH] sglang: initialize RISC-V SHM collectives in CPU bootstrap

Upstream-Reference: https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/18072
Upstream-Status: Downstream (RISC-V CPU bootstrap integration)

_init_cpu_threads_env only enabled the shared-memory transport on Intel AMX
and ARM64 hosts. On RISC-V the SHM workspace was therefore never initialized,
while is_shm_available() already reports the ported collectives as usable.
Tensor-parallel runs would then call torch.ops.sgl_kernel.shm_allreduce on
an uninitialized workspace. Gate the initialization on the same
cpu_has_riscv_shm_support() capability used by is_shm_available() so the
transport is set up exactly when the collective path can be selected.

diff --git a/python/sglang/srt/distributed/bootstrap.py b/python/sglang/srt/distributed/bootstrap.py
--- a/python/sglang/srt/distributed/bootstrap.py
+++ b/python/sglang/srt/distributed/bootstrap.py
@@ -40,6 +40,7 @@
 from sglang.srt.server_args import ServerArgs
 from sglang.srt.utils import (
     cpu_has_amx_support,
+    cpu_has_riscv_shm_support,
     get_available_gpu_memory,
     is_host_cpu_arm64,
     is_npu,
@@ -52,6 +53,7 @@
 
 _is_cpu_amx_available = cpu_has_amx_support()
 _is_cpu_arm64 = is_host_cpu_arm64()
+_is_cpu_riscv_shm = cpu_has_riscv_shm_support()
 
 # A representative per-peer payload for materializing the PyNCCL P2P
 # connections used by TP LM-head all-to-all. The input/output tensors are
@@ -263,7 +265,7 @@
     local_omp_cpuid: Optional[List[int]],
     dist_init_method: Optional[str] = None,
 ) -> None:
-    if _is_cpu_amx_available or _is_cpu_arm64:
+    if _is_cpu_amx_available or _is_cpu_arm64 or _is_cpu_riscv_shm:
         parallel = get_parallel()
         # Bind OpenMP threads to CPU cores
         torch.ops.sgl_kernel.init_cpu_threads_env(local_omp_cpuid)
@@ -281,7 +283,7 @@
 
     else:
         logger.warning(
-            "init_cpu_threads_env and shared memory based AllReduce is disabled, only intel amx backend and arm64 are supported"
+            "init_cpu_threads_env and shared memory based AllReduce is disabled, only intel amx backend, arm64 and riscv64 (with sgl_kernel SHM support) are supported"
         )
 
 
